// ============================================================================
// Munaxa — Prisma schema
// Phase 1: initialization only (datasource + generator).
// Phase 2 introduces the core data model (Tenant, School, Campus, AcademicYear,
// Semester, Grade, Section, Classroom, User, Role, Permission, AuditLog) with
// tenantId on every business entity and the tenant-isolation/RLS strategy.
